{
  "appliesTo": {
    "businessTypes": "all",
    "entity": "all"
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "This toolkit is for one person running a business in South Africa. You are the owner. You are also the only worker. You have little money and little time."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "94a3aede2125f2a4",
      "id": "intro.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Everything here is free or very cheap. Every step tells you if it is required by law, or if it is only a good idea."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "c6a10ac5bd47fca8",
      "id": "intro.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The honest truth first"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "829b7e177e064737",
      "id": "the-honest-truth-first",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "The honest truth first"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "You do not need most of the things people tell you to get."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "f9ca494253a008bd",
      "id": "the-honest-truth-first.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "You can legally start selling today, under your own name, with no company registration, no logo, no website, and no accountant. Many people spend R15,000 and three months on setup before they earn one rand. Do not do that."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "0240a09bdc835490",
      "id": "the-honest-truth-first.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Earn money first. Add the formal parts as the business grows."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "c30301335d8ca696",
      "id": "the-honest-truth-first.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Order to do things"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "e80cac3889e9bd0b",
      "id": "order-to-do-things",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Order to do things"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Work through these in order. Do not skip ahead."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "b4579c2dc5dc4ae7",
      "id": "order-to-do-things.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "hash": "1a68678b84d74654",
      "id": "order-to-do-things.2",
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Sell something and get paid. Even once. This proves people want it."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Open a separate bank account for business money. Keep business money and home money apart from day one. Ask the bank what your instant payment limits are; you will need them."
          }
        ]
      ],
      "kind": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "start": 1
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "If you will work from home with no shop, read "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Working from home and meeting safely"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "core/working-from-home-and-safety",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " before your first sale. It is short and it covers the habits that stop you being scammed."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "2f2e074c75144c3d",
      "id": "order-to-do-things.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "hash": "2a3368367387208e",
      "id": "order-to-do-things.4",
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Pick a name and a simple look. Use file "
          },
          {
            "c": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Branding prompts"
              }
            ],
            "doc": "branding/branding-prompts",
            "t": "link"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Make your quote and invoice templates. Use file "
          },
          {
            "c": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Which template to use when"
              }
            ],
            "doc": "paperwork/which-template-to-use-when",
            "t": "link"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Check if your kind of business needs a licence to sell. Read "
          },
          {
            "c": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "What you need to sell things"
              }
            ],
            "doc": "core/what-you-need-to-sell-things",
            "t": "link"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", then open your business type in "
          },
          {
            "label": "04-business-types/",
            "section": "business-types",
            "t": "docref"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Some businesses may not trade without a licence."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Sort out SARS. Use file "
          },
          {
            "c": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Tax and SARS"
              }
            ],
            "doc": "core/tax-and-sars",
            "t": "link"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Do this even if you earn nothing."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Decide if you need a registered company. Use file "
          },
          {
            "c": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Register: what you actually need"
              }
            ],
            "doc": "core/register",
            "t": "link"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Most solo businesses do not need one in year one. If you decide yes, read "
          },
          {
            "c": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Running a Pty Ltd"
              }
            ],
            "doc": "core/running-a-pty-ltd",
            "t": "link"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " before you register, not after."
          }
        ]
      ],
      "kind": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "start": 3
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Steps 5 and 6 are the two that get people fined. Do not leave them for later."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "0d619fe5ec712e5a",
      "id": "order-to-do-things.5",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
