    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "How to use the AI prompts"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "31b34bde4f6dcc7c",
      "id": "how-to-use-the-ai-prompts",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "How to use the AI prompts"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The prompts are written for any AI chat tool. They work in Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, or Copilot. The free versions are fine."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "545f1388d9423ebc",
      "id": "how-to-use-the-ai-prompts.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Rules for using them:"
        }
      ],
      "hash": "aeb32be14b37a24d",
      "id": "how-to-use-the-ai-prompts.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Copy one prompt at a time. Paste it. Wait for the answer. Do not paste the next prompt until you are happy with the current one."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "2a09618bf08ed95c",
      "id": "how-to-use-the-ai-prompts.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Every branding prompt gives you 5 options. Read all 5. Pick the one closest to what you want, even if it is not perfect. Then tell the AI what you like and what you do not like, and ask for 5 new versions. Do this two or three times. The third round is usually much better than the first."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "a153c1fcd6991d3c",
      "id": "how-to-use-the-ai-prompts.4",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Never accept the first answer. The first answer is the average answer."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "b0cb05d45ae9aa79",
      "id": "how-to-use-the-ai-prompts.5",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Start a new chat for each big task. A chat that is too long makes the AI forget things."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "cb9710735f50e058",
      "id": "how-to-use-the-ai-prompts.6",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The AI will sometimes be wrong about South African law, prices, and forms. It is a writing helper, not a lawyer. Check anything legal against the official website named in this toolkit."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "6a15c664bf7d0af4",
      "id": "how-to-use-the-ai-prompts.7",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "If the legal words are hard"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "84f135491991db80",
      "id": "if-the-legal-words-are-hard",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "If the legal words are hard"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Some paragraphs are written close to the law so you can check them. Each one is followed by a line starting "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "In plain words:"
            }
          ],
          "t": "strong"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " that says the same thing simply. Read that one instead if you need to."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "6a889a97da533620",
      "id": "if-the-legal-words-are-hard.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Each heavy file also starts with a table of the words it uses. And "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Glossary"
            }
          ],
          "doc": "lookup/glossary",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " explains every abbreviation."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "451f7823b706c8e8",
      "id": "if-the-legal-words-are-hard.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "About the numbers in this toolkit"
        }
      ],
      "depth": 2,
      "hash": "eb3c617e217eac99",
      "id": "about-the-numbers-in-this-toolkit",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "About the numbers in this toolkit"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Tax rules, fees, and thresholds were checked in September 2026. The tax year running now is 1 March 2026 to 28 February 2027."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "4eb08d1c131ae81d",
      "id": "about-the-numbers-in-this-toolkit.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "South African tax thresholds changed a lot in the 2026 Budget. Older blogs and older AI answers still use the old numbers. If a website tells you the VAT threshold is R1 million, that site is out of date."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "2faa56137304be73",
      "id": "about-the-numbers-in-this-toolkit.2",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Before you pay anything or file anything, check the current figure on the official site:"
        }
      ],
      "hash": "16216f6bf7a4d706",
      "id": "about-the-numbers-in-this-toolkit.3",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "hash": "79f496d9517e96c0",
      "id": "about-the-numbers-in-this-toolkit.4",
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "SARS: "
          },
          {
            "c": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "www.sars.gov.za"
              }
            ],
            "external": true,
            "href": "https://www.sars.gov.za",
            "t": "link"
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Company registration: "
          },
          {
